Manage jj-backed current-session strap history.

Usage:
  strap history init
  strap history status
  strap history snapshot --message "after session setup"
  strap history log
  strap history new
  strap history restore <rev>
  strap history ui

History is stored in the current session directory. Session mutations automatically snapshot with jj; `snapshot` remains available for explicit checkpoints. `ui` launches jjui in the current session.
